# Pairs with AbsentMarkerHolds. Rule 2 of the gate rollout dropped: the marker
# state is initialised in a turn in which a hand-off begun before the gate opened
# is still in flight, so an absent marker reads as closed while that hand-off can
# still admit.
MODULE: AbsentMarkerHoldsInitWithHandOffInFlight
TARGET: AbsentMarkerHolds
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: L's marker state is initialised while a marker-less hand-off is still in flight
PERTURBS: MarkInit

--- FIND
    /\ ~hfly
    /\ ~mInit
    /\ mInit' = TRUE
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: no check for a hand-off in flight.
    /\ ~mInit
    /\ mInit' = TRUE
--- END
